###############################################################################
# 后台 P0 · 媒体上传(MinIO)
# 用法: 先跑登录拿到 adminToken; 再选本地文件路径替换下面的 < 行
###############################################################################

@baseUrl = http://127.0.0.1:8000

### 1. 管理员登录
POST {{baseUrl}}/backend/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "username": "admin", "password": "admin123" }

> {%
client.global.set("adminToken", response.body.data.token);
%}

### 2. 上传封面图(purpose=cover|image|avatar)
POST {{baseUrl}}/backend/media/upload
Authorization: {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----MediaBoundary

------MediaBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="purpose"

cover
------MediaBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="cover.jpg"
Content-Type: image/jpeg

< /tmp/cover.jpg
------MediaBoundary--

### 3. 上传视频源片(purpose=video)
POST {{baseUrl}}/backend/media/upload
Authorization: {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----MediaBoundary

------MediaBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="purpose"

video
------MediaBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="demo.mp4"
Content-Type: video/mp4

< /tmp/demo.mp4
------MediaBoundary--
